WEBVTT

00:07:58.436 --> 00:08:00.716
One accelerates the other.

00:08:00.756 --> 00:08:04.556
One propels the next forward.

00:08:04.596 --> 00:08:08.436
For instance, with cheap
green electricity,

00:08:08.436 --> 00:08:12.436
we will soon have cheap green hydrogen.

00:08:12.436 --> 00:08:17.156
Green hydrogen can be used
to power homes and factories.

00:08:17.156 --> 00:08:22.396
It can be used to make fertilizer,

00:08:22.396 --> 00:08:24.796
or it can be used
to make steel without emissions.

00:08:24.836 --> 00:08:26.996
Tremendous opportunities.

00:08:27.036 --> 00:08:30.516
We're developing
storage systems and batteries